OOZIE-1989 NPE during a rerun with forks (rkanter)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `compare` method in `LiteWorkflowInstance.java` attempting to compare two `Date` objects that could be `null`, leading to a NullPointerException when either `date1` or `date2` was not set (i.e., when the corresponding node instances did not have end times recorded). This situation arose during reruns with forks, where the workflow state may not have been fully initialized or where certain nodes had not completed execution.

